# The working dataset tree stays out of the repository: generate it locally
# (npm run generate:datasets -> data/) and load it per upload. The published
# sample datasets under public/data/ are committed on purpose — the underlying
# reports are open data (dl-de/by-2-0) and ship with the site as read-only
# "Beispieldaten". The leading slash anchors the pattern to the repo root.
